@startuml breadknife-provider
participant "Hyprland" as hypr
participant "breadknife（bread）" as bread
participant "系统 DBus 服务" as svc
participant "调节工具" as tools

hypr -> bread: monitoradded / monitorremoved / workspace>> / activewindow / urgent>>
bread -> hypr: hyprctl -j 查询 / dispatch workspace
bread -> svc: Get / PropertiesChanged / MPRIS 方法
bread -> tools: pamixer / brightnessctl / ddcutil
@enduml
